1
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:49,420
=No.9 Hunter=

2
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:51,360
=Episode 11=

3
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:09,920
Ah.

4
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:13,239
You wretched Yu Linjun!

5
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:15,280
Once I break the Stone Curse

6
00:01:15,680 --> 00:01:17,079
and fuse with the Stone's power,

7
00:01:17,079 --> 00:01:18,920
I'll tear you apart!

8
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:22,680
Who are you looking for, goddess?

9
00:01:22,959 --> 00:01:24,359
You can tell me.

10
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:27,719
We Xuanwu Sect's network
spans the world.

11
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,280
We can help you find him.

12
00:01:33,879 --> 00:01:35,640
Who are you, by the way?

13
00:01:36,319 --> 00:01:38,519
Stop with the "goddess" already.

14
00:01:38,719 --> 00:01:39,959
It's so cringey.

15
00:01:39,959 --> 00:01:40,799
Gives me the creeps.

16
00:01:42,319 --> 00:01:43,359
My name is Zhu Yu.

17
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:48,439
This is a family heirloom.

18
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:50,000
With this,

19
00:01:50,319 --> 00:01:52,799
I can find whoever you're looking for.

20
00:01:53,719 --> 00:01:56,159
Consider it thanks for saving

21
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:59,000
the little dog demon and me.

22
00:02:00,439 --> 00:02:01,239
Ah!

23
00:02:07,359 --> 00:02:08,280
Young Master Zhu,

24
00:02:09,919 --> 00:02:10,919
that was completely coincidence.

25
00:02:11,439 --> 00:02:12,280
It was nothing.

26
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:13,520
No need to thank us.

27
00:02:15,719 --> 00:02:17,680
My father always said

28
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:19,080
one must repay kindness.

29
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:20,240
You saved me.

30
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:21,319
I must thank you.

31
00:02:21,919 --> 00:02:24,560
Especially you, Goddess Ziyan.

32
00:02:25,439 --> 00:02:26,479
A good deed needs no reward.

33
00:02:26,919 --> 00:02:28,520
We shouldn't take
what's precious to you.

34
00:02:29,719 --> 00:02:31,039
Please take it back.

35
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:35,039
Please...

36
00:02:35,039 --> 00:02:35,840
Ah!

37
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:43,240
To be honest,

38
00:02:44,319 --> 00:02:45,120
Goddess Ziyan,

39
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:46,759
the moment you appeared,

40
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:47,840
I knew for certain

41
00:02:47,879 --> 00:02:49,560
you were the one
I've been searching for.

42
00:02:50,039 --> 00:02:52,080
This is
my family's Five Spirits Pendant.

43
00:02:52,319 --> 00:02:53,560
It brings good fortune to its bearer.

44
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:55,560
Think of it

45
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,680
as my betrothal gift.

46
00:02:58,400 --> 00:02:59,199
(Hmm?)

47
00:02:59,319 --> 00:03:00,840
(This pendant is actually...)

48
00:03:07,039 --> 00:03:07,840
Hmm?

49
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:10,000
This is hardly proper.

50
00:03:10,439 --> 00:03:12,199
Besides, you already have a rouge box.

51
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:13,680
Take it back.

52
00:03:14,879 --> 00:03:16,159
Ah.

53
00:03:17,759 --> 00:03:18,520
Seriously,

54
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:20,000
what are you two doing? Reciting poetry?

55
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,199
All that mumbling.

56
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:22,479
So annoying.

57
00:03:22,639 --> 00:03:23,719
Just go, go, go!

58
00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:31,159
In this life,

59
00:03:31,439 --> 00:03:32,759
I've chosen you.

60
00:03:49,439 --> 00:03:50,560
It seems

61
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:53,879
our Ruyi Pavilion

62
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:56,120
will be making a match.

63
00:03:59,039 --> 00:04:00,319
The Purestone Bloom.

64
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:01,400
Hmm.

65
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,599
Where did you see it?

66
00:04:02,639 --> 00:04:03,759
Why is it embroidered here?

67
00:04:05,240 --> 00:04:06,039
So

68
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,199
this is called Purestone Bloom.

69
00:04:08,639 --> 00:04:10,199
What a beautiful name.

70
00:04:11,439 --> 00:04:14,080
But I promised him

71
00:04:15,319 --> 00:04:17,000
I wouldn't tell anyone.

72
00:04:18,519 --> 00:04:19,319
Him?

73
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:21,160
Who is he?

74
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:22,959
I'm afraid I can't say.

75
00:04:26,439 --> 00:04:29,600
The reason I have a foothold
in the Wilds of Lize

76
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,920
is my reputation for trust.

77
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:36,120
I hope you understand.

78
00:04:47,279 --> 00:04:48,079
However,

79
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:55,680
I can give you a piece of information

80
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:57,560
from the deepest part
of the Wilds of Lize.

81
00:04:58,199 --> 00:05:00,439
Worth a fortune.

82
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:03,480
You'll give it to me for free?

83
00:05:03,839 --> 00:05:04,759
Why?

84
00:05:06,079 --> 00:05:06,879
Maybe

85
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:09,279
because the moment I saw you,

86
00:05:09,519 --> 00:05:11,639
I inexplicably took a liking to you.

87
00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:13,199
Maybe

88
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:15,360
we have a past-life connection.

89
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:21,160
The Divine Stone is hidden

90
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:23,519
in the deepest part.

91
00:05:25,319 --> 00:05:27,279
(If there's a Stone
in the Wilds of Lize,)

92
00:05:27,959 --> 00:05:29,920
(does that mean I'm not the only one?)

93
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:33,800
Thank you.

94
00:05:38,433 --> 00:05:39,232
Thanks.

95
00:05:44,399 --> 00:05:46,120
What do you think of Young Master Zhu?

96
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:49,680
Top-tier.

97
00:05:50,079 --> 00:05:52,480
Give me specifics. How is he top-tier?

98
00:05:54,399 --> 00:05:56,160
He is the heir of Xuanwu Sect.

99
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,519
Status.

100
00:05:58,199 --> 00:05:59,199
Position.

101
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:00,720
Wealth.

102
00:06:01,079 --> 00:06:02,120
Looks.

103
00:06:02,839 --> 00:06:04,160
So you are saying

104
00:06:04,439 --> 00:06:06,519
our little junior
will accept his proposal?

105
00:06:07,839 --> 00:06:08,920
Quite likely.

106
00:06:11,519 --> 00:06:15,759
Zhu Yu is the best choice for her.

107
00:06:17,959 --> 00:06:18,759
Traitor.

108
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:24,160
What do you think, Yuanchu?

109
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:26,199
After the sky is mended,

110
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,360
she will be free.

111
00:06:29,839 --> 00:06:30,920
In the future,

112
00:06:31,319 --> 00:06:33,720
she will meet many more outstanding men.

113
00:06:35,879 --> 00:06:37,480
Maybe one day, she'll fall for someone

114
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:39,680
and find her own happiness.

115
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:41,839
That would be a good thing.

116
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:44,920
Yuanchu,

117
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:47,360
how can you give up
before you've even tried?

118
00:06:47,839 --> 00:06:50,079
You're the future Sect Master
of Yuanzhen.

119
00:06:50,319 --> 00:06:52,560
You have better looks,

120
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:53,680
better skills,

121
00:06:54,079 --> 00:06:57,120
better everything.
You and her would be perfect.

122
00:07:01,399 --> 00:07:02,399
Don't you think?

123
00:07:05,079 --> 00:07:05,959
Not necessarily.

124
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:09,879
If the love is real,

125
00:07:10,439 --> 00:07:12,040
does it really need every waking moment?

126
00:07:12,319 --> 00:07:15,079
You should suffer a little
for love, too.

127
00:07:16,199 --> 00:07:17,800
A little suffering builds character.

128
00:07:18,319 --> 00:07:19,879
That's how you rise above the rest.

129
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:23,519
Yuanchu,

130
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:26,040
I really think she's great.

131
00:07:26,639 --> 00:07:27,680
Even though she is a demon,

132
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:29,439
she is a genuinely good one.

133
00:07:30,079 --> 00:07:31,639
Her personality
balances yours perfectly.

134
00:07:34,199 --> 00:07:35,439
I support this match.

135
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:37,720
Thank you, Senior.

136
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:38,920
Hmm.

137
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:41,240
I see it now.

138
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:43,680
Yes, yes, yes!

139
00:07:44,199 --> 00:07:45,240
That is exactly it!

140
00:07:46,319 --> 00:07:47,639
I need to press forward.

141
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:49,079
Bolder with every fall.

142
00:07:50,079 --> 00:07:50,959
No.

143
00:07:50,959 --> 00:07:51,839
I disagree.

144
00:07:52,959 --> 00:07:54,480
We should bring Young Master Zhu along.

145
00:07:54,639 --> 00:07:56,439
More people, more strength, right?

146
00:07:57,519 --> 00:07:59,439
Wonderful! Goddess Ziyan,

147
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:01,800
you're finally letting me close to you!

148
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:05,439
Stop calling me "goddess."

149
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:06,879
It gives me the creeps.

150
00:08:06,959 --> 00:08:08,439
Just call me by my name.

151
00:08:08,879 --> 00:08:10,519
Okay, Ziyan.

152
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:14,720
Then you can just call me Yuyu.

153
00:08:14,759 --> 00:08:17,000
Do not be so formal
with "Young Master Zhu."

154
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:19,800
Yuyu?

155
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:20,800
Hmm.

156
00:08:21,079 --> 00:08:21,519
Yu.

157
00:08:21,519 --> 00:08:21,959
Hmm.

158
00:08:21,959 --> 00:08:22,759
Yuyuyu.

159
00:08:22,759 --> 00:08:23,319
Hmm.

160
00:08:23,319 --> 00:08:28,160
Sounds like a "Yoo-hoo" to call a horse!

161
00:08:29,439 --> 00:08:30,519
See?

162
00:08:30,519 --> 00:08:32,000
She doesn't love you.

163
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:34,320
She's just a fickle demoness

164
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:36,200
messing around with other men.

165
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:37,360
Once the sky is sealed,

166
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:38,720
kill her at once!

167
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:41,799
(If she does not love me,)

168
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:42,879
(could I actually kill her?)

169
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:44,039
Hehe.

170
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:45,120
(But...)

171
00:08:45,679 --> 00:08:47,879
(why does watching her
with someone else)

172
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,840
(feel so...)

173
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:51,960
(terrible?)

174
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,559
Ziyan.

175
00:08:56,559 --> 00:08:57,360
What's wrong?

176
00:08:58,720 --> 00:08:59,519
Nothing.

177
00:09:00,679 --> 00:09:02,159
My old ailment just flared up.

178
00:09:02,519 --> 00:09:03,639
Please step out for a moment.

179
00:09:03,639 --> 00:09:04,639
I need to rest.

180
00:09:04,639 --> 00:09:05,240
Oh, okay.

181
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:07,000
I'll go find a physician.

182
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:09,120
Ah!

183
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:11,399
No, you can't leave.

184
00:09:11,399 --> 00:09:13,600
You need to use your power to help me.

185
00:09:16,799 --> 00:09:18,000
Why aren't you saying anything?

186
00:09:20,879 --> 00:09:21,960
You don't want to?

187
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:25,000
No, I don't.

188
00:09:25,919 --> 00:09:26,840
I just...

189
00:09:28,559 --> 00:09:29,840
Ugh, forget it.

190
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:32,039
Men are so petty and dramatic.

191
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:34,679
Is this because of Zhu Yu?
Are you sulking?

192
00:09:36,039 --> 00:09:37,320
I said I am not.

193
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,399
Fine.

194
00:09:40,399 --> 00:09:41,200
I will channel...

195
00:09:41,559 --> 00:09:42,679
channel my power to suppress it for you.

196
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:43,639
No.

197
00:09:53,519 --> 00:09:54,360
I don't like it.

198
00:09:56,639 --> 00:09:57,840
You don't like what?

199
00:09:58,759 --> 00:10:00,360
I don't like you talking to him.

200
00:10:00,759 --> 00:10:02,240
I don't like you saying his name.

201
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:03,759
I don't like you eating with him.

202
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:05,559
I don't like the way you look at him.

203
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:06,919
I don't like you smiling at him.

204
00:10:06,919 --> 00:10:08,639
I don't like everything between you two,

205
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:09,840
because I like you.

206
00:10:34,759 --> 00:10:35,799
Are you jealous?

207
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:39,639
No, I'm not.

208
00:10:56,639 --> 00:10:57,879
Are you still mad now?

209
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:01,519
How about now?

210
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:05,639
Ah.

211
00:12:03,690 --> 00:12:07,618
♪I drink the rain of this mortal world,
and seek the path I chose♪

212
00:12:07,890 --> 00:12:11,063
♪How much sorrow and joy have I known?♪

213
00:12:11,104 --> 00:12:14,618
♪With this flesh and blood,
I chase the distant light♪

214
00:12:14,804 --> 00:12:17,738
♪Just to see clearly
the memories of this drifting life♪

215
00:12:18,018 --> 00:12:24,788
♪Let the wind sweep away
this heavy air of sorrow♪

216
00:12:25,434 --> 00:12:32,122
♪Do not forget the tangled paths
that you and I have crossed♪

217
00:12:33,028 --> 00:12:36,698
♪Let towering waves come crashing down;
I'll fight against the tide♪

218
00:12:36,808 --> 00:12:40,498
♪I shatter the hollow fate
they wrote for me♪

219
00:12:40,670 --> 00:12:46,904
♪With a heart free of regret,
I'll face the heavens and earth♪
